``` IX-05 | Volume and Index Caps Forcing Premature Cold-to-Frozen
    Interpretation and RCA: Splunk Administrator Field Manual (Gaurav Malik),
    entry IX-05. https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0HRXCT384

    Run on: SH with all indexers as search peers (splunk_server=* fans the
    REST call out to them).
    Query: Main query
    If this returns nothing, run probes/IX-05-probe-rest.spl to confirm the
    data it reads exists here.
```
| rest splunk_server=* /services/data/indexes datatype=all count=0
| search disabled=0 NOT title=_*
| eval cfg_retention_d=round(frozenTimePeriodInSecs / 86400, 0)
| eval oldest_t=strptime(minTime, "%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%S%z")
| eval actual_retention_d=round((now() - oldest_t) / 86400, 1)
| eval size_pct=round(100 * currentDBSizeMB / maxTotalDataSizeMB, 1)
| stats max(cfg_retention_d) as cfg_retention_d
        min(actual_retention_d) as actual_retention_d_min
        max(size_pct) as size_pct_max
        values(homePath) as home_path values(coldPath) as cold_path
        by title
| eval retention_gap_d=cfg_retention_d - actual_retention_d_min
| where size_pct_max > 90 OR retention_gap_d > 7
| sort - retention_gap_d
